# Defect d-lane-room-mixedown-1 (lane room-mixedown, 2026-11-26; panel 260's
# R2 to R4, provisional, author ratification pending): a name of the layer's
# that the header of another module's group calls from a `static inline`
# body is told at that module's group, in the module whose object refers to
# it, never at this module's first group, whose `answer` reaches nothing of
# the layer.
use late

extern "a.h"
    function answer() -> i64

function main()
    print(answer())
    print(late.stopped())
